          "snippet": {
            "text": "def PowEqns (P Q R : ℕ) : Prop :=\n  (Q = 0 ∧ R = 0 ∧ P = 1) ∨ (Q = 0 ∧ 0 < R ∧ P = 0) ∨\n    (0 < Q ∧ ∃ b m a0 a1 a2 : ℕ, AlphaEqns a0 (Q + 4) (R + 1) ∧ b = a0 + Q ^ 2 + 2 ∧\n      m + Q ^ 2 + 1 = b * Q ∧ P < m ∧ AlphaEqns a1 b R ∧ AlphaEqns a2 b (R + 1) ∧\n      (P + b * a1) % m = (Q * a1 + a2) % m)",
            "line": 17,
            "truncated": false
